## Author's draft config (untested, as sketched in-chat)

# Pi Pico as Picoprobe (CMSIS-DAP)
source [find interface/cmsis-dap.cfg]
transport select jtag
adapter speed 1000

# iPhone X (A11 Chip)
source [find target/armv7a.cfg]
set _CPUTAPID 0x4ba00477
reset_config trst_and_srst will that work?
